    "updated_at": "2022-09-19T20:53:14Z",
    "body": "A small update: Safari has implemented `video.requestVideoFrameCallback`, and @youennf and I discussed merging the WICG/video-rvfc spec (renamed from WICG/video-raf) into the HTML standard at TPAC.\r\n\r\nI am closing this PR and will create a new one referencing this one for context. I intend on starting this work in October. Thanks!",
